              with the Yang-Mills-Higgs
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+functional"} action functional
              is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monotone+function"} monotonically descreasing
              and in particular fulfills:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi YMH
